{"title":"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Problems 8,9 and 10 use the data found in the accompanying paragraph and table:\n</p>\n<center>\n<p>Juan organizes the stamps in his collection by country and by the decade in which they were issued. The prices he paid for them at a stamp shop were: Brazil and\nFrance, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/5/8757dee3e82d0a50141b170e1833938fa70ca912.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\cent$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"17\" /> each, Peru <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/8/f48fc6923835b31862020dfd12315b061ac78bae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\cent$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> each, and Spain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/8/9f893e3ab4cb9eb07c7cadd340db577658d3f8c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\cent$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> each. (Brazil and Peru are South American countries and France and Spain are in Europe.)\n</p>\n</center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/7/f679bb00d960506089f9cd632a80bd218347de4e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] /* AMC8 2002 #8, 9, 10 Problem */ size(3inch, 1.5inch); for ( int y = 0; y &amp;lt;= 5; ++y ) { draw((0,y)--(18,y)); } draw((0,0)--(0,5)); draw((6,0)--(6,5)); draw((9,0)--(9,5)); draw((12,0)--(12,5)); draw((15,0)--(15,5)); draw((18,0)--(18,5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;50s&quot;, (7.5,4.5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;4&quot;, (7.5,3.5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;8&quot;, (7.5,2.5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;6&quot;, (7.5,1.5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;3&quot;, (7.5,0.5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;60s&quot;, (10.5,4.5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;7&quot;, (10.5,3.5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;4&quot;, (10.5,2.5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;4&quot;, (10.5,1.5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;9&quot;, (10.5,0.5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;70s&quot;, (13.5,4.5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;12&quot;, (13.5,3.5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;12&quot;, (13.5,2.5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;6&quot;, (13.5,1.5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;13&quot;, (13.5,0.5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;80s&quot;, (16.5,4.5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;8&quot;, (16.5,3.5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;15&quot;, (16.5,2.5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;10&quot;, (16.5,1.5)); draw(scale(0.8)*&quot;9&quot;, (16.5,0.5)); label(scale(0.8)*&quot;Country&quot;, (3,4.5)); label(scale(0.8)*&quot;Brazil&quot;, (3,3.5)); label(scale(0.8)*&quot;France&quot;, (3,2.5)); label(scale(0.8)*&quot;Peru&quot;, (3,1.5)); label(scale(0.8)*&quot;Spain&quot;, (3,0.5)); label(scale(0.9)*&quot;Juan&#39;s Stamp Collection&quot;, (9,0), S); label(scale(0.9)*&quot;Number of Stamps by Decade&quot;, (9,5), N);[/asy]\" width=\"362\" height=\"148\" />\n</p><p>The average price of his '70s stamps is closest to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/8/4f88ff572af3261584779673f8018009fe029b16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 3.5\\cent \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 4\\cent \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 4.5\\cent \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 5\\cent \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 5.5\\cent$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"435\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Juan has a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/9/ad9fe7b8021b88f35966229933cb91bfc40ca571.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 + 12 + 6 + 13 = 43$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"175\" height=\"15\" /> stamps from the '70s, and these stamps cost a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8dac70ca8677dcda73543576d8f8a046d4f7ee0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 \\cdot \\$0.06 + 12 \\cdot \\$0.06 + 6 \\cdot \\$0.04 = 13 \\cdot \\$0.05 = \\$2.33$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"418\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>The average price of these stamps is therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/2/ee24c59835f7c0e78cb05543fbe2be099bc680d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2.33 \\div 43 \\approx \\$0.0542$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"167\" height=\"17\" />, which is closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/6/0a62732dff9f215281cc03036207d458baae858c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 5.5\\cent}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"78\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/61m1NMsMCRI\">https://youtu.be/61m1NMsMCRI</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 8\">2002 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2002\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2